      "updated": 1783596627468,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(How to order?)\nIndexed poppies can be activated\n(focused/opened) with an operator\nmode \"poppy_select\" action keybind. >\nhit a number > poppy opens",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(How to order?)\nIndexed poppies can be activated (focused/opened) with an operator mode \"poppy_select\" action keybind. > hit a number > poppy opens",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8uRPZc0l1BAHqeOCRj05u",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1056.3821572222223,
      "y": 216.1111111111111,
      "width": 301.6637573242188,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aL4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1304991356,
      "version": 879,
      "versionNonce": 1077822404,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "Wr8Y4TjE-g1YTaIGdq7WS",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1783595026965,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\"poppy_action\" is the only bind\ndefined in the \"content window\" buffer\nthis is how the potential for conflict\nwith editor/shell/tui running inside\npoppy is minimized and keeps single\npoint of access to actions",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\"poppy_action\" is the only bind defined in the \"content window\" buffer\nthis is how the potential for conflict with editor/shell/tui running inside poppy is minimized and keeps single point of access to actions",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YQVGzV7SFqHOgWLpGYvH_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1056.3821572222223,
      "y": 450.55555555555554,
      "width": 301.6637573242188,
      "height": 340,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aL6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1351380036,
      "version": 1652,
      "versionNonce": 1932974332,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "3E6XpvauueCBFLYxyJzhj",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1783596850152,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hitting \"poppy_action\" (depending on\nwhat I decide to do with\n\"menu_autohide\" immediately shows\nback/or just makes focusable and\nrefocuses cursor into \"menu/list panel\"\nall actions of \"landing view\" (hit\n\"poppy_action\" again to toggle, hit\nnumber to open/focus a poppy, hit\nselect bind to select item under\ncursor) aavailable the same way.\nAdditionally, there is\n\"popy_kill_current\". If I go with\nautohide approach, there is no need\nto have \"hide ui\" action nor bind.\nUsers decide if they want list of\npoppies persistent or it autohides in\nconfig, declaratively choosing behavior.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Hitting \"poppy_action\" (depending on what I decide to do with \"menu_autohide\" immediately shows back/or just makes focusable and refocuses cursor into \"menu/list panel\"\nall actions of \"landing view\" (hit \"poppy_action\" again to toggle, hit number to open/focus a poppy, hit select bind to select item under cursor) aavailable the same way.\nAdditionally, there is \"popy_kill_current\". If I go with autohide approach, there is no need to have \"hide ui\" action nor bind. Users decide if they want list of poppies persistent or it autohides in config, declaratively choosing behavior.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DjuggNOB8tWnIL3CxagLI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1456.2681362222222,
      "y": 489.57626955555554,
      "width": 301.6637573242188,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aL7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 316222916,
      "version": 2035,
      "versionNonce": 1387624900,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783596783959,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In menu kill action kills the current or\npossibly can be an operaor mode bind\nif prepended with poppy index or kill\nfocused under cursor (similar to\npoppy_select)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In menu kill action kills the current or possibly can be an operaor mode bind if prepended with poppy index or kill focused under cursor (similar to poppy_select)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UJZVNpjrQjg6lv0hWBSEa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1456.2681362222222,
      "y": 637.0762695555555,
      "width": 301.6637573242188,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aL7V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2134008388,
      "version": 2216,
      "versionNonce": 1561752828,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783596822392,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "As stated before, poppy_action key\nhit while in this state will toggle\nentire thing off",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "As stated before, poppy_action key hit while in this state will toggle entire thing off",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5wrz_HMCwjkWPBklnAK9E",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 664.1599349999999,
      "y": 380.5555555555556,
      "width": 301.6637573242188,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aL8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1259302084,
      "version": 857,
      "versionNonce": 1547244412,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "njX4ffdw_UQPMOpWWH74L",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1783596622877,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Alternative \"oil.nvim-style\" select\n> can place the cursor on a line with\nan item and hit <CR> (one of binds\nexposed to config in plugin opts.keys)\n> poppy opens",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Alternative \"oil.nvim-style\" select\n> can place the cursor on a line with\nan item and hit <CR> (one of binds exposed to config in plugin opts.keys)\n> poppy opens",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "L7es-vR0W-FcNd9wWcyIM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 664.1599349999999,
      "y": 688,
      "width": 301.6637573242188,
      "height": 220,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aLG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1409219452,
      "version": 1155,
      "versionNonce": 56756676,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783596622879,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Side effects of opening a poppy:\n\n- The list Ui transforms into the\n\"sidebar\" form, its buf becomes\nunfocusable\n(to explore, leave the sidebar or hide,\nor maybe expose behind\n\"autohide_menu\" opt? )\n\n- Focus moves into content window\n    if term then insertenter",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Side effects of opening a poppy:\n\n- The list Ui transforms into the \"sidebar\" form, its buf becomes unfocusable\n(to explore, leave the sidebar or hide, or maybe expose behind \"autohide_menu\" opt? )\n\n- Focus moves into content window\n    if term then insertenter",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "F3cqxmEgsvwXmxuXLJ4jc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 662.1599349999999,
      "y": 534,
      "width": 301.6637573242188,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aLO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1855127876,
      "version": 1371,
      "versionNonce": 1659855996,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783596622879,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "in this view only the idex numbers,\nselect bind and \"poppy_action\" are\nbound. Based on buffer's ft users can\ndisable any other default/config binds\nthey find problematic themselves.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "in this view only the idex numbers, select bind and \"poppy_action\" are bound. Based on buffer's ft users can disable any other default/config binds they find problematic themselves.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YcHehI50S3ri-e3xIvKWQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1460.909935,
      "y": 233,
      "width": 301.6637573242188,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aLP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 563186244,
      "version": 1938,
      "versionNonce": 1602493124,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783596403083,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Additional UI efficiency gain:\n> Bottom line panel no longer needed\nto take the whole width Can be only 1\nor 2 lines high hints panel directly\nbelow list, same width as list panel.\n> It only needs to list \n\"Toggle off <poppy_action key>\"\n\"Kill poppy <poppy_kill key>\"\n> In active poppy window state it\nonly needs to list \"poppy action key\"",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Additional UI efficiency gain:\n> Bottom line panel no longer needed to take the whole width Can be only 1 or 2 lines high hints panel directly below list, same width as list panel.\n> It only needs to list \n\"Toggle off <poppy_action key>\"\n\"Kill poppy <poppy_kill key>\"\n> In active poppy window state it only needs to list \"poppy action key\"",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1ckps7CQLlR4KMN0E0vjc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1059.9377127777777,
      "y": 832.3333333333333,
      "width": 301.6637573242188,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aLQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 705235268,
      "version": 2019,
      "versionNonce": 1620873796,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783596724922,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "with this setup:\nhitting \"poppy_action\" twice should\nretain current behavior of toggling\nthe plugin float off. There is\npossiblity of brief flash of \"menu\npanel\" if it is configured with\nautohide, but I am sure this can be\nhacked around like having the menu z-\nindexed below wrapper when hidden\nand turning it off in 2 steps like 1.\nmake focusable, receive cursor, accept\nbinds right away 2. change z-index to\ntop with a small debounce of 100ms or\nsomething similar.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "with this setup:\nhitting \"poppy_action\" twice should retain current behavior of toggling the plugin float off. There is possiblity of brief flash of \"menu panel\" if it is configured with autohide, but I am sure this can be hacked around like having the menu z-indexed below wrapper when hidden and turning it off in 2 steps like 1. make focusable, receive cursor, accept binds right away 2. change z-index to top with a small debounce of 100ms or something similar.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
